---
---

<section id="about" class="about-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
            <h2>About <span class="gradient-text">Me</span></h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">What I build, how I learn, and where I'm headed.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-grid">
            <div class="story-card fade-in">
                <h3>I make Discord bots, and now I'm learning Rust</h3>
                <div class="story-paragraphs">
                    <p>
                        I write Discord bots in <strong class="text-highlight">JavaScript</strong> and <strong class="text-highlight">TypeScript</strong>. I've been doing this for a while, and it's still what I use the most.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Lately I'm moving more and more toward <strong class="text-highlight">Rust</strong>. It takes a bit longer to learn, but I like the challenge, and I want to get better at it by building real projects.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        My plan is to keep practicing, try out small ideas, and contribute to <strong class="text-highlight">open source</strong> when I feel ready.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="focus-deck fade-in">
                <div class="focus-card">
                    <div class="focus-top">
                        <div class="focus-icon">
                            <img
                                src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon/icons/discordjs/discordjs-original.svg"
                                width="32"
                                height="32"
                                alt="Discord.js"
                                draggable="false"
                            />
                        </div>
                        <div class="focus-meta">
                            <h4>Discord Bots</h4>
                            <span class="focus-label">TypeScript & JavaScript</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="focus-desc">
                        Bots with commands and automatic tasks that help Discord servers run smoothly.
                    </p>
                    <div class="card-pills">
                        <span class="tech-pill">
                            <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon/icons/typescript/typescript-original.svg" width="14" height="14" alt="TS" />
                            TypeScript
                        </span>
                        <span class="tech-pill">
                            <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon/icons/javascript/javascript-original.svg" width="14" height="14" alt="JS" />
                            JavaScript
                        </span>
                        <span class="tech-pill">
                            <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon/icons/discordjs/discordjs-original.svg" width="14" height="14" alt="Discord" />
                            Discord.js
                        </span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="focus-card">
                    <div class="focus-top">
                        <div class="focus-icon">
                            <img
                                src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon/icons/rust/rust-original.svg"
                                width="32"
                                height="32"
                                alt="Rust"
                                draggable="false"
                            />
                        </div>
                        <div class="focus-meta">
                            <h4>Rust & Open Source</h4>
                            <span class="focus-label">Projects I'm building</span>
                        </div>
                        <span class="badge-learning">Learning</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="focus-desc">
                        Learning how Rust works by building small projects, and I want to contribute to open source later.
                    </p>
                    <div class="card-pills">
                        <span class="tech-pill">Rust</span>
                        <span class="tech-pill">Open Source</span>
                        <span class="tech-pill">Command line</span>
                        <span class="tech-pill">Personal Projects</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .about-section {
        padding: 7rem 0;
        position: relative;
    }

    .section-subtitle {
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        margin-top: 0.5rem;
    }

    .about-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
        gap: 3.5rem;
        align-items: stretch;
    }

    .story-card {
        background: #0c0c0f;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 2.8rem;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 2rem;
    }

    .story-card h3 {
        font-size: 2rem;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-weight: 800;
        line-height: 1.25;
        letter-spacing: -0.8px;
    }

    .story-paragraphs {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1.2rem;
    }

    .story-paragraphs p {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        color: #a1a1aa;
        line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .text-highlight {
        color: #ffffff;
        font-weight: 600;
    }

    .focus-deck {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1.8rem;
        justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .focus-card {
        background: #0c0c0f;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 2.2rem;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1.2rem;
        transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
    }

    .focus-card:hover {
        border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
    }

    .focus-top {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 1rem;
    }

    .focus-icon {
        width: 52px;
        height: 52px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .focus-meta {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        flex: 1;
    }

    .focus-meta h4 {
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #ffffff;
    }

    .focus-label {
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        color: #a1a1aa;
    }

    .badge-learning {
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
        color: #d4d4d8;
        font-weight: 600;
    }

    .focus-desc {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: #a1a1aa;
        line-height: 1.65;
        margin: 0;
    }

    .card-pills {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .tech-pill {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.4rem;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        border-radius: 8px;
        color: #e4e4e7;
        font-weight: 500;
    }

    @media (max-width: 968px) {
        .about-section {
            padding: 4rem 0;
        }

        .about-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 2.5rem;
        }

        .story-card {
            padding: 2.2rem;
        }

        .story-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
        }
    }
</style>
